        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.431,
            0.353,
            0.45
          ],
          "content": "**(d) pollen grains.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.141,
            0.45,
            0.852,
            0.47
          ],
          "content": "**4. What are the advantages of sexual reproduction over asexual reproduction?**"
